{%- comment -%}
  main-cart — the basket.

  New in v3: live's cart.json names this type but v3 had neither the section
  nor templates/cart.json, so every /cart URL 404'd. Same pre-flight failure as
  the collection page (docs/build-state.md).

  Ported from live's 49.9KB T4S section, which exposed six settings of which
  ONE was on. Dropped with the rest: the shipping calculator, order notes,
  live rates, gift wrap and the default-country picker — all `false` on live,
  and a control nobody has ever switched on is not a feature. Dropping a
  setting is safe; the five IDs simply stop being declared.

  Block types are frozen: price / btn / tax / agree / btnck, exactly live's
  names, so templates/cart.json keeps working. `guarantee` is new.

  ── THE GROUPED RING SET ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

  A configured ring reaches the basket as up to FIVE lines: the setting, the
  centre stone (or its setting fee), the side pair (or its fee), and the
  engraving fee. They are separate lines because their prices are independent
  — see docs/build-state.md, 01/09/2026.

  Presented as one block with a combined total, Ed 01/09/2026.

  THE LINK IS `Ring SKU`, and it already exists. Verified 01/09/2026 by reading
  addOnLines() in assets/fye-ui.js, which tags every companion line:

      var tag = { 'For ring': ring.title, 'Ring SKU': ring.sku || '' };

  So the value is the SETTING line's variant SKU and this page needs no change
  to fye-ui.js to group. The key is named ONCE below. Live uses the same key,
  which is where v3 took it from — do not "tidy" it to an underscore-prefixed
  name without changing addOnLines() in the same commit.

  A ring variant with no SKU tags its companions with an empty string. Those
  companions simply do not group and render as ordinary lines, which is the
  right failure: visible, and priced correctly.

  ── ONE SETTING CLAIMS A SKU ONCE ─────────────────────────────────────────

  Two of the same setting in one basket share a SKU, so a naive match would
  hang the same stones under both and count them twice in both combined
  totals. The first setting claims the SKU; a second identical setting renders
  as an ordinary line. Live has this bug; it is cheap to not have.

  Quantity inside a group is fixed (Ed): these are one-off rings, and a set
  whose five lines could drift out of step with each other is a fulfilment
  problem, not a convenience.

  ── WHAT NEEDS JAVASCRIPT, AND WHAT DOES NOT ──────────────────────────────

  Nothing here needs it to RENDER. Quantity and removal are plain links to
  /cart/change; the discount field is Shopify's own `name="discount"` input,
  which carries to checkout through the ordinary cart POST. fye-ui.js adds two
  behaviours on top:

    · removing any line in a group asks first, then takes the whole set —
      otherwise a setting reaches checkout with no stone, or the reverse;
    · the centre-fee reconciler (below) corrects the fee line quietly and in
      place, without reloading (Ed, 01/09/2026).

  Without JavaScript both degrade to "the shopper can still fix it by hand",
  which is a degraded basket rather than a wrong order.

  ── THE CENTRE-FEE RECONCILER ─────────────────────────────────────────────

  When a customer supplies their own centre diamond we sell no stone, we
  charge to set one — and Shopify cannot attach a fee to an existing line, so
  the fee travels as its own line. The two can drift apart in an abandoned
  basket. `centre_fee_variant_id` tells fye-ui.js which line is the fee; the
  ring lines are the ones whose "Centre Diamond" property says the customer is
  supplying it. Ed, 01/09/2026: correct it quietly, in place, and ADD THE FEE
  BACK if it was deleted while the ring stayed. Live only ever corrected a fee
  line that was still present, so a deleted one meant free setting.

  The default id is live's and is UNVERIFIED on this store — see
  docs/build-state.md. Blank switches the whole behaviour off.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign band = s.band | default: 'white'

  comment
    THE LINK PROPERTY. One assign, one place to change. Must stay in step with
    addOnLines() in assets/fye-ui.js.
  endcomment
  assign link_key = 'Ring SKU'

  comment
    Every link value in the basket, delimited on BOTH sides so a lookup cannot
    match a partial SKU: '|ENG123|' can never be found inside '|ENG1234|'.
  endcomment
  assign links = ''
  for item in cart.items
    assign lv = item.properties[link_key]
    if lv != blank
      assign links = links | append: '|' | append: lv | append: '|'
    endif
  endfor

  comment
    SKUs already grouped, so a second identical setting cannot claim the same
    companions. See the header.
  endcomment
  assign claimed = ''
-%}

<section class="fye-cart band band--{{ band }}"
         data-screen-label="Cart"
         data-fye-cart
         data-fee-variant="{{ s.centre_fee_variant_id }}"
         data-link-key="{{ link_key }}">
  <div class="wrap">

    {%- if cart.item_count == 0 -%}

      <div class="cart__empty">
        <h2 class="cart__emptyhead">{{ s.empty_heading | default: 'Your basket is empty' }}</h2>
        {%- if s.empty_copy != blank -%}
          <p class="lead cart__emptycopy">{{ s.empty_copy }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <a class="btn" href="{{ s.empty_link | default: '/collections/all' }}">
          {{ s.empty_label | default: 'Start browsing' }}
        </a>
      </div>

    {%- else -%}

      <div class="cart__layout">

        <div class="cart__items">
          <ul class="cart__list" role="list">
            {%- for item in cart.items -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign is_companion = false
                if item.properties[link_key] != blank
                  assign is_companion = true
                endif

                assign is_parent = false
                if is_companion == false and item.sku != blank
                  assign needle = '|' | append: item.sku | append: '|'
                  if links contains needle
                    if claimed contains needle
                      comment
                        A second setting with the same SKU. Its companions are
                        already shown under the first, so this renders plain.
                      endcomment
                    else
                      assign is_parent = true
                      assign claimed = claimed | append: needle
                    endif
                  endif
                endif
              -%}

              {%- comment -%}
                Companions render inside their setting's group, never on their
                own. A companion whose setting is no longer in the basket falls
                through to the standalone branch below, so an orphan is visible
                rather than silently missing — and its "For ring" property then
                shows, which is exactly when that property earns its place.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- if is_companion -%}
                {%- assign orphan = true -%}
                {%- for parent in cart.items -%}
                  {%- if parent.sku == item.properties[link_key] -%}
                    {%- assign orphan = false -%}
                    {%- break -%}
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endfor -%}
                {%- unless orphan -%}
                  {%- continue -%}
                {%- endunless -%}
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if is_parent -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign combined = item.final_line_price
                  assign set_keys = item.key
                  for c in cart.items
                    if c.properties[link_key] == item.sku
                      assign combined = combined | plus: c.final_line_price
                      assign set_keys = set_keys | append: ',' | append: c.key
                    endif
                  endfor
                -%}
                <li class="cart__group">
                  <p class="cart__grouphead">{{ s.group_title | default: 'Your complete ring' }}</p>

                  {%- render 'cart-line',
                        item: item,
                        line: forloop.index,
                        locked: true,
                        label: 'Setting',
                        set_keys: set_keys,
                        link_key: link_key -%}

                  {%- for c in cart.items -%}
                    {%- if c.properties[link_key] == item.sku -%}
                      {%- liquid
                        assign ct = c.product.title | downcase
                        if ct contains 'side diamond'
                          assign clabel = 'Side diamonds'
                        elsif ct contains 'engraving'
                          assign clabel = 'Engraving'
                        elsif ct contains 'setting fee' or c.properties['Setting service'] != blank
                          assign clabel = 'Setting service'
                        else
                          assign clabel = 'Centre diamond'
                        endif
                      -%}
                      {%- render 'cart-line',
                            item: c,
                            line: forloop.index,
                            locked: true,
                            label: clabel,
                            set_keys: set_keys,
                            link_key: link_key -%}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}

                  <p class="cart__grouptotal">
                    <span>Combined total</span>
                    <strong>{{ combined | money }}</strong>
                  </p>
                </li>
              {%- else -%}
                <li class="cart__row">
                  {%- render 'cart-line',
                        item: item,
                        line: forloop.index,
                        locked: false,
                        label: '',
                        set_keys: '',
                        link_key: link_key -%}
                </li>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <aside class="cart__side">
          <form action="{{ routes.cart_url }}" method="post" novalidate class="cart__form">
            {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
              {%- case block.type -%}

                {%- when 'price' -%}
                  <div class="cart__sub" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    <span>Subtotal</span>
                    <strong>{{ cart.total_price | money }}</strong>
                  </div>

                {%- when 'tax' -%}
                  <p class="fine cart__tax" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    {{ block.settings.note | default: 'Taxes and delivery are calculated at checkout.' }}
                  </p>

                {%- when 'agree' -%}
                  <label class="cart__agree" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    <input type="checkbox" required>
                    <span>{{ block.settings.text | default: 'I have read and accept the terms and conditions.' }}</span>
                  </label>

                {%- when 'btnck' -%}
                  <button type="submit" name="checkout" class="btn btn--block cart__checkout" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    {{ block.settings.label | default: 'Checkout' }}
                  </button>

                {%- when 'btn' -%}
                  <a class="btn btn--outline btn--block"
                     href="{{ block.settings.url | default: '/collections/all' }}"
                     {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    {{ block.settings.title | default: 'Continue shopping' }}
                  </a>

              {%- endcase -%}
            {%- endfor -%}

            {%- comment -%}
              Shopify's own field. Posted with the cart form it travels through
              to checkout and is applied there — no JavaScript, and no second
              request. It cannot show the shopper the value of the code before
              checkout; nothing on the cart page can.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if s.enable_discount -%}
              <div class="cart__discount">
                <label for="cart-discount">Discount code</label>
                <input type="text" id="cart-discount" name="discount" autocomplete="off">
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </form>

          {%- if s.delivery_note != blank -%}
            <p class="fine cart__delivery">{{ s.delivery_note }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- assign guarantees = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'guarantee' -%}
          {%- if guarantees.size > 0 -%}
            <div class="panel cart__guarantee">
              <p class="eyebrow">{{ s.guarantee_title | default: 'The For Your Eternity guarantee' }}</p>
              <ul class="cart__glist" role="list">
                {%- for block in guarantees -%}
                  <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    {%- render 'icon', name: block.settings.icon, class: 'icon--sm' -%}
                    <span>{{ block.settings.text }}</span>
                  </li>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </ul>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </aside>

      </div>

    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
.fye .cart__layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 360px;
  gap: var(--s10);
  align-items: start;
}

.fye .cart__list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.fye .cart__list > li { margin: 0; }
.fye .cart__row { border-bottom: var(--hairline); }
.fye .cart__row:first-child { border-top: var(--hairline); }

/* A group is a single surface: one hairline around the set, none between the
   lines inside it, so the block reads as one purchase rather than four. */
.fye .cart__group {
  border: var(--hairline);
  margin-bottom: var(--s6);
  background: var(--white);
}
.fye .cart__grouphead {
  margin: 0;
  padding: var(--s4) var(--s5);
  background: var(--ivory);
  border-bottom: var(--hairline);
  font-size: var(--fs-eyebrow);
  font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-eyebrow);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.fye .cart__grouptotal {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: var(--s4);
  margin: 0;
  padding: var(--s4) var(--s5);
  border-top: var(--hairline);
  background: var(--ivory);
  font-size: var(--fs-small);
}
.fye .cart__grouptotal strong { font-weight: var(--fw-medium); }

/* ---- one line ---------------------------------------------------------- */
.fye .cart__line {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 100px minmax(0, 1fr) auto auto;
  grid-template-areas: 'media body qty price' 'media body remove remove';
  gap: var(--s2) var(--s5);
  align-items: start;
  padding: var(--s5);
}
.fye .cart__group .cart__line + .cart__line { border-top: var(--hairline); }

.fye .cart__media { grid-area: media; display: block; }
.fye .cart__img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover; background: var(--ivory); }
.fye .cart__img--ph { display: block; }

.fye .cart__body { grid-area: body; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s2); }
.fye .cart__role {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: var(--fs-eyebrow);
  font-weight: var(--fw-medium);
  letter-spacing: var(--tr-eyebrow);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-soft);
}
.fye .cart__name { font-size: var(--fs-small); line-height: 1.35; }
.fye .cart__name:hover { color: var(--sage); }
.fye .cart__variant { margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-fine); color: var(--ink-soft); }

.fye .cart__props { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: var(--fs-fine); color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fye .cart__props > li { margin: 0; }
.fye .cart__propkey { font-weight: var(--fw-medium); }

.fye .cart__qty { grid-area: qty; }
.fye .cart__qtyfixed { margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-fine); color: var(--ink-soft); white-space: nowrap; }
.fye .cart__stepper { display: flex; align-items: center; border: var(--hairline); }
.fye .cart__step {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 44px;
  min-height: 44px;
  color: var(--ink);
}
.fye .cart__step:hover { background: var(--ivory); color: var(--sage); }
.fye .cart__qtynum { min-width: 32px; text-align: center; font-size: var(--fs-small); }

.fye .cart__price { grid-area: price; margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-small); font-weight: var(--fw-medium); white-space: nowrap; }

.fye .cart__remove {
  grid-area: remove;
  justify-self: end;
  font-size: var(--fs-fine);
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
  line-height: 1.2;
}
.fye .cart__remove:hover { color: var(--sage); }

/* ---- summary ----------------------------------------------------------- */
.fye .cart__side { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s6); position: sticky; top: var(--s6); }
.fye .cart__form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s4); border: var(--hairline); padding: var(--s6); }

.fye .cart__sub {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: var(--s4);
  padding-bottom: var(--s4);
  border-bottom: var(--hairline);
  font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
}
.fye .cart__sub strong { font-weight: var(--fw-medium); }
.fye .cart__tax { margin: 0; }

.fye .cart__agree { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: var(--s3); margin: 0; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: var(--fs-fine); font-weight: var(--fw-light); color: var(--ink); }
.fye .cart__agree input { width: 18px; min-height: 18px; height: 18px; flex: 0 0 auto; margin-top: 3px; }

.fye .cart__discount { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.fye .cart__delivery { margin: 0; }

.fye .cart__guarantee { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s4); }
.fye .cart__glist { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s3); font-size: var(--fs-fine); }
.fye .cart__glist > li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: var(--s3); margin: 0; }
.fye .cart__glist .icon { margin-top: 1px; }

/* ---- empty ------------------------------------------------------------- */
.fye .cart__empty { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: var(--s5); text-align: center; }
.fye .cart__emptycopy { max-width: 46ch; }

/* ---- 900: the summary stops being a column ----------------------------- */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .fye .cart__layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s8); }
  .fye .cart__side { position: static; }
}

/* ---- 560: the line stacks --------------------------------------------- */
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .fye .cart__line {
    grid-template-columns: 76px minmax(0, 1fr);
    grid-template-areas: 'media body' 'media price' 'qty remove';
    gap: var(--s3) var(--s4);
  }
  .fye .cart__remove { align-self: center; }
  .fye .cart__qty { justify-self: start; }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cart",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Basket" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "group_title",
      "label": "Grouped ring heading",
      "default": "Your complete ring",
      "info": "Shown above a setting and the stones bought with it."
    },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "enable_discount", "label": "Show discount code field", "default": true },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "centre_fee_variant_id",
      "label": "Centre setting fee variant ID",
      "default": "58461224927616",
      "info": "Used to keep the fee line in step with the rings that need it. Leave blank to switch that off."
    },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Reassurance" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "delivery_note",
      "label": "Delivery note",
      "default": "Each ring is made to order. We will confirm your delivery date by email."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "guarantee_title", "label": "Guarantee heading", "default": "The For Your Eternity guarantee" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Empty basket" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "empty_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Your basket is empty" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "empty_copy", "label": "Text", "default": "When you find a ring you love, it will appear here." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "empty_label", "label": "Button label", "default": "Start browsing" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "empty_link", "label": "Button link" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Background" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "band",
      "label": "Band colour",
      "default": "white",
      "options": [
        { "value": "white", "label": "White" },
        { "value": "ivory", "label": "Ivory" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "price", "name": "Subtotal", "limit": 1, "settings": [] },
    {
      "type": "tax",
      "name": "Tax and delivery note",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "note", "label": "Note", "default": "Taxes and delivery are calculated at checkout." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "agree",
      "name": "Terms checkbox",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "Text", "default": "I have read and accept the terms and conditions." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "btnck",
      "name": "Checkout button",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "label", "label": "Label", "default": "Checkout" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "btn",
      "name": "Secondary button",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Label", "default": "Continue shopping" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "url", "label": "Link" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "guarantee",
      "name": "Guarantee line",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "icon",
          "label": "Icon",
          "default": "shipping",
          "options": [
            { "value": "shipping", "label": "Delivery" },
            { "value": "resize", "label": "Resizing" },
            { "value": "warranty", "label": "Warranty" },
            { "value": "ethical", "label": "Ethical sourcing" },
            { "value": "certificate", "label": "Certification" },
            { "value": "scales", "label": "Fair pricing" },
            { "value": "guidance", "label": "Personal guidance" }
          ]
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "Text", "default": "Free insured UK delivery" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
